<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Editorial Standards</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">How we create, review, and maintain trustworthy guides.</p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <%= siteTitle %> publishes original, practical guides about online video and audio downloads. Our goal is to help users understand how to save content they own or have permission to use, while respecting copyright and platform terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">1. Original and Accurate Content</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Every guide is written or reviewed by our editorial team. We test the steps we describe, update instructions when platforms change, and correct errors as soon as they are reported.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">2. Sources and Verification</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">We rely on official documentation, open-source tooling (such as yt-dlp), and direct testing. When we reference third-party policies, we link to the official source so readers can verify the information themselves.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">3. Independence and Transparency</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed"><%= siteTitle %> is an independent project and is not affiliated with YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, or any other platform. We do not accept payment to alter reviews, rankings, or recommendations.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">4. Responsible Use</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">We encourage readers to follow local copyright laws and each platform's Terms of Service. Our guides include clear reminders to only download content the reader owns or has permission to use.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">5. Corrections and Feedback</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">If you find an error, outdated step, or have a suggestion, please contact us through the <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Contact</a> page. We review feedback regularly and update guides when needed.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">6. Advertising and Sponsorships</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">We may display ads to support the service. Sponsored or affiliate content, if any, will be clearly labeled. Editorial decisions are made independently of advertisers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Contact the Editorial Team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
